    "input_texts": [
      "Title: Sort Asset List by Function and Close Task\nDescription: Workflow to sort the Asset List by 'Asset function' ascending and mark the task as complete.\n- Navigate to the 'All Assets' view via the 'All' menu.\n- Click 'Show / hide filter' to expand filter options.\n- Click 'Add Sort' to open the sorting configuration.\n- Select 'Asset function' from the 'Order results by' combobox.\n- Press 'Enter' to confirm the selected sort field.\n- Click 'Run filter' to apply the sorting to the list.\n- Change the task 'State' to 'Closed Complete'.\n- Click 'Update' to save the task status."
    ],
