      "Title: Asset List Sorting and Task Completion Signals\nDescription: Key UI elements and behaviors for sorting assets and updating task status.\n- The 'All Assets' link is found within the 'All' menu context.\n- Sorting configuration is accessed via the 'Add Sort' button on the list page.\n- The sort field selector is a combobox labeled 'Order results by the following fields' with a sub-option for 'Asset function'.\n- Confirmation of the sort field requires pressing 'Enter' in the combobox.\n- The sorting is applied immediately upon clicking 'Run filter'.\n- The task status dropdown is labeled 'State' and supports the option 'Closed Complete'.\n- The 'Update' button finalizes changes to the task state.\n- The URL parameter 'sysparm_query' updates to include 'ORDERBYasset_function' after sorting."
